                <note rend="inline" type="source">883.0513/181: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fish</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-11-28T12:00:00+02:00">November 28,
                        1936—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received November 28—7:44 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>68. Department’s telegram No. 43. I do not think it likely.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
